@base = http://localhost:3001
# Run with a REST Client extension, or use these JSON bodies in your HTTP client.
# Replace IDs below with IDs returned by the create endpoints.

### Liveness (200); readiness is /ready (503 until PostgreSQL repositories work)
GET {{base}}/health

### Extract - intentionally returns null fields in stub mode
POST {{base}}/api/harvest/extract
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"80 kg tomatoes ready tomorrow in Dambulla","localTimeContext":{"now":"2026-10-24T04:30:00Z","timeZone":"Asia/Colombo"}}

### Publish confirmed listing; copy response.data.id into generate
POST {{base}}/api/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{"demoFarmerId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","crop":"tomato","quantityKg":80,"pickup":{"lat":7.8742,"lng":80.6511},"readyAt":"2026-10-25T02:30:00Z","minNetMinor":1600000,"confirmed":true}

### Create order
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"demoBuyerId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","crop":"tomato","remainingKg":100,"pricePerKgMinor":22000,"delivery":{"lat":7.2906,"lng":80.6337},"deadlineAt":"2026-10-25T12:30:00Z","allowsPartial":true}

### List orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders

### List persisted weight-distance-v2 trips (empty in explicit stub mode)
GET {{base}}/api/trips

### Create trip - requires configured road routing, migrations 001/002 and API_STUBS=false
POST {{base}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{"demoTransporterId":"33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333","start":{"lat":7.95,"lng":80.65},"end":{"lat":7.25,"lng":80.63},"departureAt":"2026-10-25T03:00:00Z","availableKg":120,"corridorM":3000,"maxExtraDistanceM":10000,"maxExtraTimeS":3600,"baseMinor":35000,"perKmMinor":10000,"handlingMinor":0,"ratePerKgKmMinor":20,"pricingVersion":"weight-distance-v2"}

### Replace listingId with a real POST /api/listings result (this example ID returns 404)
POST {{base}}/api/plans/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{"listingId":"44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444"}

### Retrieve proposal - replace with response.data.plan.id from a successful generation
GET {{base}}/api/plans/88888888-8888-4888-8888-888888888888

### Decision - 404 for this synthetic ID; real stale/expired/conflicting proposals give 409
POST {{base}}/api/plans/88888888-8888-4888-8888-888888888888/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"accept"}
